  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-24T07:58:24.635Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "(This started after the 2017 Unity Update.)\nThis mainly occurs when I am lagging, and gets worse depending on how much I'm lagging. The sensitivity behaves strangely, and my horizontal sensitivity increases drastically, while my vertical sensitivity decreases to a ridiculously slow speed.\nThis makes VRC basically unplayable, which really sucks, considering that I've been playing since around September of 2017, and I feel like I'm unable to play now.\n\nEDIT: I just noticed that this problem disappears completely if you are sitting on a chair. But when you stand up, the problem comes back.",
